      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Learning more words each evening."
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Reviewing words over time."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Avoiding writing practice."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Reading only once a week."
        }
      ],
      "answerId": "B",
      "explanation": "文中说明 Maya 减少新词量并在数日后复习，后来更容易在写作中运用这些词。B 概括了这一变化。"
    }
